WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.467
Video eight. Stock: the unit, the group, the godown,
and the stock items with HSN and GST rate.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:10.749
A stock item needs a unit and a stock group.

00:00:10.679 --> 00:00:13.228
A godown tells where the stock is.

00:00:13.159 --> 00:00:18.908
The item keeps its HSN code and its GST rate.
The Stock Summary shows every item.

00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:23.559
C opens the List of Masters. The inventory
masters are in the middle.

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:29.540
Type "unit", and press Enter. The type is
Simple. The symbol is Mtr, for metres.

00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:36.456
For GST, the unit quantity code is MTR,
metres. Then two decimal places.

00:00:36.486 --> 00:00:39.904
Hisaab asks: Accept? Y for yes.

00:00:40.984 --> 00:00:44.936
Esc, C, and type "stock gr" for Stock Group.

00:00:45.636 --> 00:00:49.655
The group is Fabrics, under Primary. Ctrl+A
saves it.

00:00:50.017 --> 00:00:54.767
Then a godown: Ring Road Warehouse. A godown
is a place where you keep stock.

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:57.218
Ctrl+A.

00:00:58.509 --> 00:01:00.525
Now the stock item.

00:01:01.935 --> 00:01:05.286
Cotton Fabric, under Fabrics, in metres.

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:15.642
The opening stock: 500 metres at 120 rupees, in Ring Road
Warehouse. Hisaab calculates 60,000 rupees.

00:01:15.672 --> 00:01:22.089
For GST, specify the HSN code, 5208, and the
GST rate: 5%.

00:01:24.389 --> 00:01:26.539
Ctrl+A saves the item.

00:01:26.569 --> 00:01:34.720
The second item is Silk Fabric: 200 metres at
450 rupees, HSN 5007, and also 5%.

00:01:36.469 --> 00:01:41.555
Esc, then S: the Stock Summary. Fabrics: 700
metres.

00:01:41.585 --> 00:01:45.604
Enter shows each item with its quantity, its
rate and its value.

00:01:47.775 --> 00:01:51.458
The opening stock is worth ₹1,50,000.

00:01:51.388 --> 00:01:54.605
Silk Fabric is ₹90,000 of it.

00:01:54.805 --> 00:01:59.021
Your stock is ready. Next: a sales invoice
with GST.

